as disclosed in the Company&rsquo;s public filings with the SEC, to the knowledge of the Company, the Company&rsquo;s &ldquo;internal
controls over financial reporting&rdquo; and &ldquo;disclosure controls and procedures&rdquo; are effective.</FONT></P>

