have a Material Adverse Effect.</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(ll)
<U>Margin Rules</U>. Neither the issuance, sale, and delivery of the Placement Shares nor the application of the proceeds thereof by
the Company as described in the Registration Statement and the Prospectus will violate Regulation T, U, or X of the Board of Governors
of the Federal Reserve System or any other regulation of such Board of Governors.</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1in">&nbsp;</P>

