<U>Insurance</U>. The Company and each of its Subsidiaries carry, or are covered by, insurance in such amounts and covering such risks
as the Company and each of its Subsidiaries reasonably believe are adequate for the conduct of their properties and as is customary for
companies of similar size engaged in similar businesses in similar industries.</FONT></P>

